{
  "schema_version": "prompt-runtime.program-scenario.v1",
  "story_path": "user_stories/path-diagnostic-ports.md",
  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "AC1",
      "text": "In `setup` mode when another `pdd` shadows a symlink to this `pdd` on `PATH`, `pathDiagnostic` probes only the selected candidate once, lists the candidates in order, explains environment-activation PATH reordering, and outputs both the absolute Node-plus-pdd command and the `export PATH` + `hash -r` fix."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC2",
      "text": "In `workflow` mode when `PATH` selects a different `pdd`, `pathDiagnostic` returns a single one-line shadowing warning with `\"$PDD_BIN\"`, and when `PDD_PATH_DIAGNOSTIC_PROBE` is `\"1\"`, returns `lines: []` without calling `host.whichPdd` or `host.probeVersion`."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC3",
      "text": "Passing an unsupported `mode` fails with `invalid_path_diagnostic_mode`."
    }
  ],
